**Dive into the guide below.** As you configure a garden — choosing frame size, modules, and crops — observe how [Docs Assembler](https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=netoftrees.documentation-assembler) manages intricate decision logic. Each option spawns a new branch, and with every level you progress, those branches increase exponentially.

Without a '**Single Source of Truth**', this complexity would create an unmanageable mess. Yet here, updates are effortless and consistent across the entire knowledge base.

